ews  ever going to hear our driving  instructors have a unique opportunity to  influence driving behavior at the very  start of a young person's driving career  the honest truth is a true partnership  giving driving instructors a seat at the  top table and making sure what we  provide them is worthwhile for too long  there has been a void between the public  services and driving schools and the  honest truth aims to bridge that gap the  project is growing from strength to  strength because of the enthusiasm of  the individuals involved in the agencies  and especially the drive and instructors  who have been on board with us from the  beginning of the project more driving  instructors should be involved in fact  all of us should be involved on the  driving community the authorities are  all working together for the first time  which is good to see but we should all  be involved not should be need to  believe there are many many different  initiatives across the country to try  and reduce these issues the honest truth  is designed to actually work with these  initiatives rather than standing on its  own our aim is not to patronize  instructors but to provide them with  free resources support and motivation to  help them deliver the safer driving  messages it's not only our job to teach  people to drive but to teach them to  live one small change can make a huge  difference and all we ask is that one  change is made by everybody on the roads  for the sake of people's families for  the sake of everyone they care about  well  the moment of madness really does lead  to what we all suffer which is  definitely a lifetime full of sadness  for the loss of my brother  you
 

